  "faqs": [
    {
      "question": "Is the Starter plan really free?",
      "answer": "Yes. Starter is free forever for up to 2 users and 1,000 contacts. There's no credit card required and no time limit. Upgrade only when you need more users or features."
    },
    {
      "question": "How does the 14-day trial work?",
      "answer": "Growth and Business plans include a 14-day trial with every feature unlocked. You won't be charged unless you add billing details and choose to continue. If you don't, your account moves to Starter and your data stays safe."
    },
    {
      "question": "Are prices inclusive of GST?",
      "answer": "Prices in INR are exclusive of 18% GST. We issue a GST invoice for every payment, so you can claim input tax credit."
    },
    {
      "question": "Can I change plans or add users later?",
      "answer": "Any time. Upgrades take effect immediately and are prorated. Downgrades apply from your next billing cycle. You can add or remove users from Settings in a couple of clicks."
    },
    {
      "question": "What payment methods do you accept?",
      "answer": "UPI, credit and debit cards, net banking and NEFT/RTGS for annual plans. International customers can pay by card in USD."
    },
    {
      "question": "Do you offer discounts for startups or NGOs?",
